    slug: "impact-of-oral-magnesium-supplementation-on-glycemic-and-cardiometabolic-8f314aee",
    titleZh: "系统回顾：镁补充与糖尿病前期",
    titleEn: "Magnesium Supplementation and Prediabetes: A Systematic Review",
    summaryZh:
      "Original title: Impact of oral magnesium supplementation on glycemic and cardiometabolic outcomes in prediabetic adults: a systematic review and meta-analysis. - Authors: Basit A, Kumar S, Ahmed H, Babar R, Saeed SS, Siddiqui TA et al. - Journal/source: PubMed prediabetes lifestyle intervention via PubMed (Journal of diabetes and metabolic disorders) - DOI: [10.1007/s40200-025-01853-9](https://doi.org/10.1007/s40200-025-01853-9) - PubMed/source link: [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/41641401/](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/41641401/) - Open-access link: [https://doi.org/10.1007/s40200-025-01853-9](https://doi.org/10.1007/s40200-025-01853-9) - Evidence used: PubMed abstract + open-access full-text link - Published or indexed date: 2026-06-01 了解如何管理糖尿病前期对于预防其发展为2型糖尿病及其相关并发症至关重要。 这项系统回顾提供了关于可能有助于糖尿病前期管理的潜在饮食补充剂的见解，这对于临床实践和公共卫生策略都是相关的。 - 糖尿病前期是一种如果不加以管理可能会发展成2型糖尿病的状况。 - 镁补充可能对管理糖尿病前期有一定的益处，尽管并非所有效果都显著。 - 需要更大、更标准化的试验来确认镁在糖尿病前期管理中的作用。 - 镁可能是预防糖尿病的生活方式干预措施中的一个成本效益高的补充。",
    summaryEn:
      "Magnesium, a mineral that plays a role in many body processes, including insulin signaling and glucose metabolism, might help in managing prediabetes. The main outcome was fasting plasma glucose, with other outcomes including insulin sensitivity and lipid profiles. It also positively affected lipid levels, which is important for heart health. However, the effect on fasting blood sugar was not significant, and the studies included were relatively small. It's important to note that this doesn't replace the need for a healthy diet and regular exercise but could be a part of a broader strategy to prevent diabetes. More research is needed to confirm these effects and to determine the best forms and doses of magnesium. - More research is needed to fully understand magnesium's role. Understanding how to manage prediabetes is crucial for preventing the progression to type 2 diabetes and its associated complications. This systematic review provides insights into a potential dietary supplement that could aid in prediabetes management, which is relevant for both clinical practice and public health strategies. - Prediabetes is a condition that, if not managed, can progress to type 2 diabetes. - Magnesium supplementation may offer some benefits for managing prediabetes, though not all effects were significant. - Larger, more standardized trials are needed to confirm the role of magnesium in prediabetes management. - Magnesium could be a cost-effective addition to lifestyle interventions for diabetes prevention.",
    bodyZh:
      "- Original title: Impact of oral magnesium supplementation on glycemic and cardiometabolic outcomes in prediabetic adults: a systematic review and meta-analysis.\r\n- Authors: Basit A, Kumar S, Ahmed H, Babar R, Saeed SS, Siddiqui TA et al.\r\n- Journal/source: PubMed prediabetes lifestyle intervention via PubMed (Journal of diabetes and metabolic disorders)\r\n- DOI: [10.1007/s40200-025-01853-9](https://doi.org/10.1007/s40200-025-01853-9)\r\n- PubMed/source link: [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/41641401/](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/41641401/)\r\n- Open-access link: [https://doi.org/10.1007/s40200-025-01853-9](https://doi.org/10.1007/s40200-025-01853-9)\r\n- Evidence used: PubMed abstract + open-access full-text link\r\n- Published or indexed date: 2026-06-01\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n了解如何管理糖尿病前期对于预防其发展为2型糖尿病及其相关并发症至关重要。 这项系统回顾提供了关于可能有助于糖尿病前期管理的潜在饮食补充剂的见解，这对于临床实践和公共卫生策略都是相关的。\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n- 糖尿病前期是一种如果不加以管理可能会发展成2型糖尿病的状况。\r\n- 镁补充可能对管理糖尿病前期有一定的益处，尽管并非所有效果都显著。\r\n- 需要更大、更标准化的试验来确认镁在糖尿病前期管理中的作用。\r\n- 镁可能是预防糖尿病的生活方式干预措施中的一个成本效益高的补充。",
    bodyEn:
      "Magnesium, a mineral that plays a role in many body processes, including insulin signaling and glucose metabolism, might help in managing prediabetes.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThe main outcome was fasting plasma glucose, with other outcomes including insulin sensitivity and lipid profiles.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nIt also positively affected lipid levels, which is important for heart health. However, the effect on fasting blood sugar was not significant, and the studies included were relatively small.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nIt's important to note that this doesn't replace the need for a healthy diet and regular exercise but could be a part of a broader strategy to prevent diabetes.\r\n\r\nMore research is needed to confirm these effects and to determine the best forms and doses of magnesium.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n- More research is needed to fully understand magnesium's role.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nUnderstanding how to manage prediabetes is crucial for preventing the progression to type 2 diabetes and its associated complications.\r\n\r\nThis systematic review provides insights into a potential dietary supplement that could aid in prediabetes management, which is relevant for both clinical practice and public health strategies.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n- Prediabetes is a condition that, if not managed, can progress to type 2 diabetes.\r\n- Magnesium supplementation may offer some benefits for managing prediabetes, though not all effects were significant.\r\n- Larger, more standardized trials are needed to confirm the role of magnesium in prediabetes management.\r\n- Magnesium could be a cost-effective addition to lifestyle interventions for diabetes prevention.",
